     5	`python3` are on PATH.
     6	
     7	## Inputs
     8	
     9	- `prompt.py` — the exact original HumanEval task prompt. It contains the
    10	  required entry-point signature, natural-language contract, examples, and any
    11	  helper code intentionally supplied with the task. It contains no completed
    12	  implementation of the target function. Do not modify it.
    13	- `py2mpy.py` — the fixed CPython-AST to K-constructor translator. Do not
    14	  modify it.
    15	- `reference-semantics/` — the supplied read-only K semantics for Python. It
    16	  is not a full Python semantics. Read it, but do not modify any file in it.
    17	
    18	## Kit workflow
    19	
    20	The Kit K-verification skills are installed and discoverable by the harness.
    21	Start with `using-kit/SKILL.md` and follow its routing. In particular, apply
    22	the shared proof-extension contract and validate Gate A, Gate B, and Gate C.
    23	Write `PROOF.md` beginning with the exact status required by that contract.
    24	Use the shared contract's exact `PROOF.md` headline outcomes:
    25	
