    27	  proof report.
    28	- If Gate A passes and Gate B fails, begin with `SOUND-BUT-LIMITED`.
    29	- If Gates A and B pass and Gate C fails, begin with
    30	  `FORMALLY-SOUND-UNVALIDATED`.
    31	- If Gates A, B, and C pass, begin with `VALIDATED`.
